This character sheet has been designed by Javier Aumente and has subsequently been thoroughly edited and made into a fillable form bij Joost Wijnen (flapkan@gmail.com) [morepurplemorebetter].

Other credits:
- Gretkatillor on ENworld.org for the code in this sheet that was inspired by Gretkatillor's brilliant 'Clean Sheet';
- Abacus, flask, powerbutton, scales, spiderweb, and vial icons made by Freepik;
- Fire icon made by Icomoon;
- Upload icon made by Elegant Themes;
- Pencil icon made by Situ Herrera;
- Print icon made by Heydon;
- Tablet icon made by Webalys;
- Death saves icon taken from SpadaBastarda's Advanced Character Sheet;
- Background texts (bond, flaws, personal traits, ideals) with the help of shmooel.yakov (on enworld.org);
- (sub)Class texts (class features) with the help of Fitsou, Athinar, and Noah Ivaldi (on enworld.org);
- Proofreading and clarifications of texts by Noah Ivaldi (on enworld.org);
- JavaScript variable of Wild Shape SRD beasts based on a JSON file made by droiddruid (on reddit.com).

