In this menu you can set the visibility of the area below:
   •  Show/hide the text lines for the notes below;
   •  Show/hide the Companion's Appearance box;
   •  Show/hide the Equipment section.

Here you can find the options for the Wild Shape page:
   •  Add a Wild Shape (Beasts grouped by CR);
   •  Remove a Wild Shape (will re-order and re-calculate);
   •  Change the way the Wild Shape calculations are done;
   •  Re-calculate the Wild Shapes;
   •  Reset all the Wild Shapes;
   •  Add another 'Wild Shapes' page;
   •  Remove this 'Wild Shapes' page.

The generated stats will not auto-update whenever you change something on the first page, except for when the druid level changes. You can have your Wild Shapes re-calculated using this button.

Note that the Wild Shape rules are open for interpertation and your DM might not approve with the way it is done here. For this reason, seven different ways of calculating the Wild Shapes have been given here. See the FAQ for more details on what each type of calculation means.

Here you can find the options for this Companion page:
   •  Create Familiar (as per the Find Familiar spell);
   •  Create Pact of the Chain familiar (as per the Pact of the Chain class ability);
   •  Create Mount (as per the Find Steed spell);
   •  Create Ranger's Companion;
   •  Apply one of the above to the current creature;
   •  Reset this entire page;
   •  Show/hide the Companion's Appearance box;
   •  Show/hide the Equipment section;
   •  Add another 'Companion' page;
   •  Remove this 'Companion' page.

If you just want to add a creature that has none of the special abilities granted by Find Familiar, Pact of the Chain, or Find Steed, just use the drop-down box next to "Race:".

Here you can find the options for the Adventurers League logsheets:
   •  Add another 'Adventurers Log' page;
   •  Remove this page;
   •  Reset this page;
   •  Generate the next Logsheet Entry automatically;
   •  Change the way the dates are displayed;
   •  Go to online tutorials of how to fill this sheet out.

